 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "How do you bring down a giant you can't even fight?",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.079
  },
  {
   "text": "In Homer's ancient poem,",
   "s": 3.752,
   "e": 4.941
  },
  {
   "text": "Odysseus and twelve men are trapped in a cave with Polyphemus,",
   "s": 5.171,
   "e": 8.416
  },
  {
   "text": "a one-eyed giant as tall as a house.",
   "s": 8.709,
   "e": 10.509
  },
  {
   "text": "The door is sealed with a boulder twenty-two wagons couldn't move.",
   "s": 10.902,
   "e": 13.99
  },
  {
   "text": "And the sailors are dinner.",
   "s": 14.69,
   "e": 16.051
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the problem.",
   "s": 16.725,
   "e": 17.378
  },
  {
   "text": "Even if they beat the giant,",
   "s": 17.705,
   "e": 18.961
  },
  {
   "text": "nobody else could move that rock.",
   "s": 19.161,
   "e": 20.615
  },
  {
   "text": "They need him alive,",
   "s": 20.936,
   "e": 21.851
  },
  {
   "text": "to open the door for them.",
   "s": 22.128,
   "e": 23.186
  },
  {
   "text": "So Odysseus makes a plan.",
   "s": 23.809,
   "e": 25.508
  },
  {
   "text": "He sharpens a wooden stake and hides it.",
   "s": 26.194,
   "e": 28.683
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he pours the giant strong wine until he's sleepy.",
   "s": 28.982,
   "e": 32.32
  },
  {
   "text": "When the giant asks his name,",
   "s": 32.994,
   "e": 34.339
  },
  {
   "text": "Odysseus is ready.",
   "s": 34.662,
   "e": 35.863
  },
  {
   "text": "\"My name is Nobody.\"",
   "s": 36.222,
   "e": 37.674
  },
  {
   "text": "That night,",
   "s": 38.37,
   "e": 38.749
  },
  {
   "text": "they strike the giant's one eye with the stake.",
   "s": 38.876,
   "e": 40.806
  },
  {
   "text": "He screams for help.",
   "s": 41.088,
   "e": 42.174
  },
  {
   "text": "His neighbours shout,",
   "s": 42.498,
   "e": 43.329
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Who's hurting you?\"",
   "s": 43.583,
   "e": 44.331
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Nobody is hurting me!\"",
   "s": 45.015,
   "e": 46.25
  },
  {
   "text": "So everyone goes back to bed.",
   "s": 46.933,
   "e": 48.684
  },
  {
   "text": "A cry for help that says nothing.",
   "s": 49.023,
   "e": 50.994
  },
  {
   "text": "At dawn,",
   "s": 51.653,
   "e": 52.151
  },
  {
   "text": "the blind giant rolls the stone aside and feels every sheep that walks out.",
   "s": 52.397,
   "e": 55.941
  },
  {
   "text": "But the men are clinging underneath their bellies.",
   "s": 56.204,
   "e": 58.129
  },
  {
   "text": "The giant opens the door for them himself.",
   "s": 58.778,
   "e": 60.983
  },
  {
   "text": "Brains beat size.",
   "s": 61.558,
   "e": 62.69
  },
  {
   "text": "Although,",
   "s": 63.344,
   "e": 63.907
  },
  {
   "text": "as we all know,",
   "s": 64.067,
   "e": 64.926
  },
  {
   "text": "he would still make a mistake he'd regret in the end.",
   "s": 65.115,
   "e": 67.643
  }
 ]
}